WEBVTT

00:02.540 --> 00:04.290
You can do it, Subaru!

00:25.150 --> 00:27.240
Kirihara Middle School

00:25.150 --> 00:27.240
Shizuno Middle School

00:37.540 --> 00:40.630
Make them see that halation!

00:40.630 --> 00:44.050
We'll carry out the oath we made that day.

00:44.050 --> 00:47.130
Spread out, new formation!

00:47.130 --> 00:50.600
We can see the signs as we call out for one another.

00:50.600 --> 00:56.890
Place your hopes in it, shoot, and watch the arch!

00:57.180 --> 01:01.810
I believe in you, do it like you always do.

01:01.810 --> 01:03.480
Leave it to me.

01:03.480 --> 01:10.030
Put your hands on your chest, and calm yourself down.

01:10.030 --> 01:16.330
I remember each and every granted wish,

01:16.330 --> 01:22.210
including that day I cried in secret.

01:22.210 --> 01:25.710
We're not the only ones

01:25.710 --> 01:29.260
seeing these same dreams.

01:29.260 --> 01:32.890
The sparks in those unyielding eyes

01:32.890 --> 01:36.020
that appeared in front of me,

01:36.020 --> 01:37.600
let them fly!

01:37.890 --> 01:41.020
Make them see that halation!

01:41.020 --> 01:44.360
Run into that open space!

01:44.360 --> 01:50.990
This lingering sensation, looking back on those carefree days.

01:50.990 --> 01:57.540
After saying farewell, you smile with everyone else,

01:57.540 --> 02:03.830
aim for the place you dreamed of, shoot, and watch the arch!

02:05.960 --> 02:09.730
The Stupid Man

02:06.960 --> 02:09.590
Thanks for joining our club, Kashima.

02:09.590 --> 02:11.800
You were on a great team during the middle school tournament.

02:11.800 --> 02:14.890
Just like Shizuno Middle School's Suga.

02:15.300 --> 02:18.760
<i>Yeah, but Suga beat us in the end.</i>

02:19.350 --> 02:21.890
Me too, in my last match...

02:21.890 --> 02:24.980
We're a lot tougher with you as a teammate now, though.

02:26.310 --> 02:30.770
Um, are you sure you got my name right?

02:30.770 --> 02:31.860
What?

02:31.860 --> 02:35.150
My last name is not Kashima. It's Kashii.

02:36.860 --> 02:40.030
S-Sorry! I really thought—

02:40.030 --> 02:41.240
Wait...

02:41.240 --> 02:43.160
Kashii?

02:43.450 --> 02:44.370
Yeah.

02:45.110 --> 02:46.900
Kashii Banri.

02:49.250 --> 02:53.140
Oh! That scrubbing feels great!

02:51.360 --> 02:53.900
Hey, are we meeting up at the station on Sunday?

02:54.240 --> 02:55.320
Yep.

02:55.320 --> 02:59.280
We'll be going to a basketball court that Hasegawa-san uses a lot.

03:00.950 --> 03:03.660
Maho, you're still soaked.

03:07.250 --> 03:09.000
I wonder what kind of place it is?

03:09.000 --> 03:11.750
Oh! I'm looking forward to it!

03:13.130 --> 03:16.050
That's not your usual towel, Airi.

03:16.050 --> 03:18.510
Yep, it's my brother's.

03:19.590 --> 03:22.310
Did you make up with your brother?

03:22.310 --> 03:25.390
No... I think my mom messed up.

03:25.390 --> 03:26.810
I see.

03:29.350 --> 03:30.860
Um...

03:31.190 --> 03:35.860
You see, I haven't been talking to my brother.

03:36.490 --> 03:41.160
I'm sure you can make up with him if the chance arrives.

03:41.160 --> 03:45.750
I <i>do</i> want to take the initiative, but I get scared.

03:45.750 --> 03:49.250
I think he's avoiding me, too.

03:49.250 --> 03:54.460
You don't need to rush things along. Just don't give up and everything will be fine.

03:55.460 --> 03:56.840
Yep.

03:57.290 --> 04:00.000
I didn't know you were Airi-chan's brother...

04:00.410 --> 04:04.040
I was surprised, too, that you two know Airi.

04:04.040 --> 04:06.050
So that means...

04:06.050 --> 04:08.800
You know her perverted coach, too?

04:10.340 --> 04:12.260
P-Perverted coach?

04:12.680 --> 04:17.350
The coach of the Keishin Academy's Girls' Basketball Team is some dumbass high school student, right?

04:18.430 --> 04:21.690
And this coach tried to assault my sister and her friends during training camp.

04:21.690 --> 04:22.980
Um, that's...

04:22.980 --> 04:26.190
He also made them play
basketball in their swimsuits!

04:26.790 --> 04:28.410
That's really disgusting!

04:28.790 --> 04:34.000
I get so worried just thinking about that bastard hanging around my sister...

04:34.000 --> 04:35.670
What's the matter, Hasegawa?

04:36.750 --> 04:38.920
I'm sorry, Banri.

04:41.080 --> 04:42.210
It's me.

04:42.590 --> 04:43.640
What?

04:44.470 --> 04:47.640
I'm her coach.

04:56.480 --> 04:58.990
I punched him without thinking.

04:58.990 --> 04:59.990
Shit!

05:21.010 --> 05:23.760
Have you heard about Airi-chan's brother?

05:24.790 --> 05:29.920
Not really. I just know they aren't on good terms with each other.

05:30.760 --> 05:32.050
I see.

05:34.010 --> 05:36.550
Okay! Let's start practice!

05:41.140 --> 05:42.810
Nice shot, Nana.

05:43.020 --> 05:44.190
Of course!

05:45.480 --> 05:46.940
You're in the way!

05:47.190 --> 05:50.440
It's time for the adults to use the court.

05:51.150 --> 05:52.230
Adults?

05:52.530 --> 05:55.150
Nana, are middle school students adults?

05:55.150 --> 05:57.530
Huh? What are you saying, Mayumi?

05:57.530 --> 06:00.740
We bought adult tickets for the bus ride here!

06:00.740 --> 06:03.410
I see. So first year middle schoolers are adults.

06:03.410 --> 06:06.430
Hey! You adults need to line up after us!

06:07.720 --> 06:10.390
These girls came here first.

06:10.390 --> 06:14.050
Do you want to wait in line or play together with them?

06:14.340 --> 06:17.050
Huh? Why should I play with grade schoolers?

06:18.180 --> 06:19.890
But I'll play you.

06:19.890 --> 06:23.350
Let's bet on who gets to use this court.

06:23.350 --> 06:25.940
Okay! Just what I wanted!

06:26.730 --> 06:28.560
That's that, then.

06:29.480 --> 06:30.860
He's here!

06:32.730 --> 06:36.400
Yo! We're playing a game with them!

06:36.570 --> 06:41.660
Huh? No thanks. Why do I have to play along?

06:43.680 --> 06:45.890
Suga Ryuuichi.

06:46.390 --> 06:49.020
Are you Hasegawa Subaru?

06:53.070 --> 06:54.860
It's been a while.

06:54.860 --> 06:59.030
I heard your school's team is no more. What a pity.

07:00.450 --> 07:03.040
I'm about to become a starter.

07:03.040 --> 07:06.790
I'll become the ace at Itoda Business High, the strongest team in the prefecture.

07:07.690 --> 07:09.520
Congratulations.

07:10.980 --> 07:12.270
That's all?

07:19.280 --> 07:21.740
Nana, be glad. I've changed my mind.

07:21.740 --> 07:23.210
Huh, what?

07:23.500 --> 07:25.420
It's been a while, so let me see...

07:27.380 --> 07:29.180
...your basketball skills.

07:31.220 --> 07:32.720
Subaru Team

07:31.220 --> 07:32.720
Ryuuichi Team

07:34.560 --> 07:36.770
Sorry about dragging the two of you into this.

07:36.770 --> 07:39.310
No, I'd be glad to help you out.

07:39.310 --> 07:42.610
W-Will you be fine with me?

07:42.610 --> 07:45.020
I asked you specifically.

07:45.280 --> 07:48.780
That Mayumi-san probably plays center.

07:48.990 --> 07:50.240
Please help me out.

07:50.240 --> 07:52.830
O-Okay! I'll do my best!

07:53.530 --> 07:55.160
Um, Subaru-san.

07:56.500 --> 08:00.330
Is he someone you definitely don't want to lose against?

08:01.370 --> 08:02.330
Yeah.

08:03.630 --> 08:05.840
I don't want to lose to him in basketball.

08:08.300 --> 08:09.880
I understand.

08:10.340 --> 08:11.590
I'll do my best!

08:25.110 --> 08:26.150
Subaru-san!

08:35.950 --> 08:37.790
I-I'm sorry!

08:37.790 --> 08:40.200
No, my pass was weak.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.120
It was my fault.

08:41.290 --> 08:43.920
I-I'll catch it next time!

08:52.260 --> 08:54.470
Tomoka's acting strange.

08:54.470 --> 08:56.890
Yeah, she's not herself.

08:57.260 --> 09:00.270
Tomoka-chan isn't the only one not doing well.

09:03.350 --> 09:05.900
<i>What do I do? I can't stop her.</i>

09:08.480 --> 09:09.740
Airi!

09:09.740 --> 09:12.530
That Mayumi-san is putting on a lot of pressure.

09:13.200 --> 09:16.530
This is really bad for Airi-chan.

09:17.950 --> 09:19.750
Do your best, everyone!

09:19.750 --> 09:21.710
Go!

09:26.210 --> 09:27.710
Airi! Behind you!

09:27.960 --> 09:29.460
Got it!

09:33.930 --> 09:37.100
Don't worry, Airi. We'll get back at them next time.

09:37.100 --> 09:39.220
Okay!

09:39.720 --> 09:41.430
Tomoka, just relax.

09:41.430 --> 09:43.980
Okay! I'll do my best!

09:49.600 --> 09:50.860
Subaru Team

09:49.610 --> 09:50.860
Ryuuichi Team

09:50.860 --> 09:53.070
I-I'm sorry! I...

09:53.070 --> 09:55.570
It's not your fault. Don't worry about it.

09:56.530 --> 09:59.830
What's this? They're so weak.

10:01.330 --> 10:04.660
Hasegawa, enough with the pregame show.

10:04.660 --> 10:09.130
Let's start the main event already. You and me.

10:09.420 --> 10:10.840
One-on-one.

10:30.570 --> 10:31.820
That was...

10:31.820 --> 10:33.440
That was a jab step.

10:33.440 --> 10:34.820
Jab step?

10:35.110 --> 10:38.240
To put it simply, it's a feint using your footwork.

10:38.240 --> 10:42.080
Suga uses the space he created and his pace to blow by him.

10:42.950 --> 10:46.330
I don't think anyone in the prefectural tournament read his feint.

10:46.790 --> 10:48.630
Subaru included.

10:49.630 --> 10:51.090
Subaru-san...

11:00.220 --> 11:03.180
What's wrong? You coming or not?

11:03.180 --> 11:05.220
Here I come, then.

11:05.430 --> 11:06.930
<i>I can't lose to his pressure!</i>

11:06.930 --> 11:08.230
<i>This is it!</i>

11:15.280 --> 11:16.990
Well, that's that.

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Name

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Nagatsuka Saki

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Date of birth

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Blood type

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Class

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Year 6,
Class C

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Height

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Bust size

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Below average for her age.
(Secretly she's concerned about it.)

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
Words to Subaru

11:20.990 --> 11:24.000
I'm sorry that Maho's always so loud...

11:25.040 --> 11:28.450
Seems like I overestimated your skills.

11:28.660 --> 11:31.380
I was kinda looking forward to playing you during the prefectural tournament.

11:31.380 --> 11:35.590
But I guess you can be part of my supporting cast.

11:37.090 --> 11:40.300
You know that's all you can become, right?

11:40.300 --> 11:43.640
That's why you went to a weak elementary school to become their key man.

11:43.890 --> 11:45.970
But that's all you've got.

11:45.970 --> 11:48.520
There's no point in playing when you can't win.

11:49.890 --> 11:51.310
That's my Ryuu!

11:51.310 --> 11:55.320
Now we can use the court all we want during our fall break!

12:02.360 --> 12:03.950
Let's go home for today.

12:03.950 --> 12:06.790
But it was all my fault...

12:06.790 --> 12:09.040
Why would it be your fault?

12:09.040 --> 12:11.920
Of course, you weren't at fault either, Airi-chan.

12:13.210 --> 12:16.420
He fought and lost by himself.

12:16.960 --> 12:18.590
Isn't that right, Subaru?

12:19.630 --> 12:20.630
Yeah...

12:21.220 --> 12:21.760
But!

12:21.760 --> 12:25.470
Subaru can't forgive himself right now.

12:25.470 --> 12:28.390
We should let him be by himself for a bit.

12:38.030 --> 12:39.150
Yes.

12:43.620 --> 12:45.450
I won't tell you to cheer up,

12:45.740 --> 12:49.960
but you <i>are</i> their coach right now.

12:49.960 --> 12:52.040
Sort yourself out by tomorrow.

13:02.130 --> 13:04.260
Your passes are too slow!

13:04.430 --> 13:07.180
You supporting cast need to do all you can to help me out!

13:10.560 --> 13:13.190
Nothing will end like this.

13:17.820 --> 13:19.990
I failed miserably...

13:19.990 --> 13:21.740
Me, too.

13:21.740 --> 13:22.990
Hey now.

13:22.990 --> 13:27.240
If you two feel down, then Hasegawa-san will feel even worse.

13:27.240 --> 13:30.040
But Tomoka wasn't playing well.

13:30.040 --> 13:34.120
That's right. Usually you can catch his passes easily.

13:34.120 --> 13:36.000
You're right.

13:36.000 --> 13:37.380
I wonder why...

13:37.380 --> 13:39.340
Oh? I know the reason.

13:39.340 --> 13:40.710
Me, too.

13:40.710 --> 13:41.220
What?!

13:41.220 --> 13:42.630
Please! Tell me!

13:42.630 --> 13:47.550
First things first, go to Hasegawa-san's house tomorrow morning.

13:47.550 --> 13:49.850
Make sure you practice with him like usual.

13:49.850 --> 13:51.350
Okay! I got it!

13:51.350 --> 13:53.940
Hmm... I wonder if that's enough...

13:53.940 --> 13:55.190
Tell me anything!

13:55.190 --> 13:56.480
I'll do my best!

13:56.480 --> 13:57.360
Hehehe!

13:57.360 --> 13:59.320
Well, then...

14:01.820 --> 14:04.450
We'll end here for today.

14:04.450 --> 14:06.450
O-Okay!

14:12.250 --> 14:15.540
<i>A jab step... How do I defend against it?</i>

14:17.210 --> 14:18.460
U-Um...

14:18.750 --> 14:21.210
T-Tomoka?

14:23.050 --> 14:27.130
The bath is where you can tell him all sorts of things!

14:27.380 --> 14:33.810
U-Um! Please! Let me w-w-wash your back!

14:55.000 --> 14:58.500
S-S-S-Sorry! I'm so sorry!

14:58.500 --> 15:01.250
No, don't worry about it!

15:05.010 --> 15:09.380
I'm really sorry. I keep messing up and I'm not useful at all...

15:09.380 --> 15:12.640
That's not true! You've helped me out a lot!

15:13.850 --> 15:14.890
But...

15:15.100 --> 15:18.310
<i>Oh... She's worried about yesterday.</i>

15:20.480 --> 15:22.690
Can you wash my back then?

15:22.690 --> 15:24.400
Okay!

15:25.360 --> 15:29.780
Subaru-san, it's huge.

15:30.740 --> 15:32.320
It's quite huge.

15:32.320 --> 15:33.780
Your...

15:34.950 --> 15:36.790
...back.

15:38.870 --> 15:43.670
I'm much too small to be of much help.

15:43.670 --> 15:48.420
Tomoka, you couldn't catch my passes yesterday, right?

15:48.420 --> 15:52.090
I'm sorry. I was useless.

15:52.090 --> 15:54.300
Are you frustrated that you couldn't catch my passes?

15:54.680 --> 15:55.810
I am!

15:57.810 --> 15:58.560
I see.

15:59.980 --> 16:04.020
If we play them again, can you catch my passes?

16:04.150 --> 16:06.860
Yes! I'll catch them! I want to catch them!

16:06.860 --> 16:11.240
I'll do all the hard training you want me to do!

16:11.410 --> 16:14.870
So please let me stay by your side!

16:16.950 --> 16:17.620
Thank you.

16:27.920 --> 16:29.880
Sorry, everyone.

16:30.470 --> 16:34.850
You saw your coach get beaten to a pulp. I disappointed all of you.

16:35.470 --> 16:38.640
I'm quite frustrated right now.

16:38.640 --> 16:41.690
I'm ashamed that I couldn't do anything in front of Suga.

16:41.690 --> 16:44.190
That's why I'm thinking of challenging him to a grudge match.

16:45.610 --> 16:49.190
So can you all help me out once again?

16:49.740 --> 16:53.950
It's not just me. I want us all to play as a team and win!

16:53.950 --> 16:56.240
I-I'll do my best, too!

16:56.240 --> 16:58.330
I don't want it to end like this!

16:58.330 --> 17:02.960
Nana-san will only be there for the fall break. We don't have much time left.

17:02.960 --> 17:04.790
That's the spirit, Subarun!

17:04.790 --> 17:05.830
Oh!

17:05.830 --> 17:07.960
Let's do our best, Onii-chan!

17:09.090 --> 17:10.170
Hey!

17:10.170 --> 17:12.050
Do you need a helper?

17:12.840 --> 17:15.430
Aoi! You're going to help me out?

17:15.430 --> 17:17.640
Don't ask stupid questions.

17:17.640 --> 17:20.720
Actually, the fifth-years asked me to come.

17:21.060 --> 17:22.430
Mimi-chan and the others?

17:22.430 --> 17:23.310
Yep.

17:23.310 --> 17:27.770
She said she'll feel bad for beating you after you've lost so many times.

17:27.770 --> 17:29.860
Sounds like something TsubaHii would say.

17:30.190 --> 17:34.950
Aoi, I've calmed down now. Thanks.

17:34.950 --> 17:36.870
Th-That wasn't anything, really...

17:37.200 --> 17:38.160
Sorry.

17:38.950 --> 17:41.290
Kashii Banri

17:42.200 --> 17:44.540
I'm sorry for punching you!

17:44.540 --> 17:46.460
W-Well, you couldn't help it!

17:46.460 --> 17:51.250
Anyone would be angry if his sister is being cared for by some stranger!

17:51.250 --> 17:53.010
Cared for?!

17:53.010 --> 17:55.680
That was a big misunderstanding! Nothing happened!

17:55.680 --> 17:58.260
I'm just saying that I didn't explain myself properly!

17:58.850 --> 18:00.720
That's good, then.

18:00.720 --> 18:05.270
Actually, I have something important to tell you.

18:10.980 --> 18:12.650
<i>Airi's coach?</i>

18:13.240 --> 18:16.700
<i>I can think of no one else. Please help me out.</i>

18:18.240 --> 18:19.910
<i>I'm sorry, I can't.</i>

18:21.910 --> 18:25.910
<i>Airi hates me.</i>

18:25.910 --> 18:28.250
<i>I'm so crude and unrefined...</i>

18:28.250 --> 18:31.750
<i>Whenever I raise my voice, she gets scared.</i>

18:32.460 --> 18:37.840
<i>She doesn't even have the courage lately to look me in the eyes.</i>

18:38.300 --> 18:42.350
<i>I don't think someone as short-tempered as me can become her coach.</i>

18:42.350 --> 18:43.520
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

18:46.730 --> 18:48.440
<i>I see.</i>

18:48.440 --> 18:50.110
<i>But you know, Banri.</i>

18:58.030 --> 19:00.280
Airi. Airi.

19:03.450 --> 19:05.120
Onii-chan?

19:05.450 --> 19:08.870
I'm sorry! I was just resting a bit...

19:09.170 --> 19:10.630
What if you catch a cold?!

19:11.960 --> 19:13.630
I'm sorry!

19:16.880 --> 19:19.720
Sorry. That was a bit harsh.

19:19.970 --> 19:22.720
<i>Airi is changing, bit by bit.</i>

19:26.390 --> 19:29.480
You've been training until very late recently.

19:29.940 --> 19:32.360
R-Really?

19:33.150 --> 19:36.480
Maybe you're right.

19:37.070 --> 19:39.360
Why are you working so hard?

19:41.530 --> 19:43.490
I want to change.

19:44.330 --> 19:49.580
There are people important to me... and a precious place where I belong,

19:49.580 --> 19:54.500
but I hate how I can't do anything for them.

19:54.790 --> 19:59.930
If I can change that something about me, even just a little...

19:59.930 --> 20:02.510
then I'll work hard at it.

20:04.010 --> 20:05.970
I see.

20:05.970 --> 20:07.520
You're great, Airi.

20:13.440 --> 20:15.650
We have a special guest to help you with your special training.

20:15.650 --> 20:18.150
Airi's brother, Kashii Banri-kun.

20:18.150 --> 20:20.030
Nice to meet'cha!

20:21.110 --> 20:23.200
You're super nervous, Banri!

20:23.200 --> 20:25.370
Maho, don't say that.

20:25.370 --> 20:27.540
Airi's brother is here!

20:27.740 --> 20:29.540
Y-Yeah...

20:32.460 --> 20:35.290
Let's give it our all, okay?

20:35.550 --> 20:39.300
Okay! I'll do my best!

20:47.100 --> 20:47.520
Tomoka!

20:47.680 --> 20:49.020
Oh?

20:49.350 --> 20:52.060
You've gotten much better!

20:52.060 --> 20:54.270
But it's still not like myself.

20:54.730 --> 20:57.770
You were the same during morning practice, though.

20:57.980 --> 21:00.150
I'm really sorry.

21:00.150 --> 21:05.070
I think it's time for you to put that plan into action, Mokkan.

21:06.320 --> 21:09.080
Oh! I want to try it out, too.

21:09.080 --> 21:12.040
No, you can't. It has to be Tomo by herself.

21:12.330 --> 21:13.580
Plan?

21:13.580 --> 21:15.420
Something that will fix her slump.

21:15.420 --> 21:16.790
Can she do that?

21:17.000 --> 21:21.260
Of course! You'll need to help her out a bit.

21:30.810 --> 21:31.980
Coming!

21:33.690 --> 21:37.320
G-Good evening!

21:37.320 --> 21:39.820
Good evening.

21:39.820 --> 21:41.110
What's up?

21:41.110 --> 21:42.700
Well...

21:42.700 --> 21:45.700
Actually... Um...

21:45.740 --> 21:50.700
Can I s-stay here t-tonight?

21:51.160 --> 21:51.950
Wha—

21:52.750 --> 21:54.960
What?!

21:55.580 --> 21:58.330
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

