22:38.960 --> 22:39.620
Ooh!

22:40.290 --> 22:41.000
Wow!

22:45.880 --> 22:48.590
Just keep on spinning!

22:48.590 --> 22:52.510
The Earth is one big basketball!

22:52.510 --> 22:56.180
I'll believe in the future and move forward!

22:55.560 --> 22:57.100
I'll keep going!

22:56.810 --> 22:59.520
Just keep on spinning!

22:59.520 --> 23:03.480
